<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Oil says has no ties with oil dealer.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Oil says has no ties with oil dealer.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd managing director Masayuki Matsushita said on Thursday that the company did not have any direct ties with Junichi Izui, an oil dealer who was arrested on Thursday on suspicion of tax evasion.</p>
</text>
